: 16px;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰租金：13000元/月</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰押金：二個月</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰管理費：400元/月&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰冷氣清洗費：依房型收取</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🚫全面禁菸</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🤗寵物可貓～須簽寵物條款</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">❄️獨立浴廁有對外窗～乾濕分離</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">❄️公用洗衣機（設有投幣烘衣機）</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">❄️頂樓有曬衣大空間</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">❄️水泥隔牆／靜巷／居住品質優</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🥘可自備電磁爐、電鍋簡易炊煮唷～</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🥰飯店式鍋爐熱水器／寒流來襲熱水都是熱呼呼</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🚌生活機能近社子菜市場、葫蘆國小、葫蘆堵市場、全聯、全家超商</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🚌交通便利：</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">（1.）一班公車轉橘紅雙線捷運</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; backgr